# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in. .dev.vars is gitignored and must stay that way.
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# CF_API_TOKEN     Cloudflare API token with Workers Scripts:Edit and R2:Edit.
#                  Create at Cloudflare → My Profile → API Tokens.
#                  For the deployed Worker use `npx wrangler secret put` rather
#                  than shipping it in wrangler.toml — [vars] there is PUBLIC,
#                  readable by anyone who can view the Worker.
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID  Whose Firestore the share Worker reads. Reads are
#                  unauthenticated by design, so this is not a secret; it lives
#                  here only so local and deployed config come from one place.

CF_API_TOKEN=
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=remidsp-98208
